<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's March oil exports at 7.5 mln barrels.</title>
<headline>Colombia's March oil exports at 7.5 mln barrels.</headline>
<text>
<p>BOGOTA, April 11 Reuter - Colombia exported 7.5 million barrels of crude oil in March, up from 4.8 million in February, the state oil company Ecopetrol reported.</p>
<p>It said oil export revenues in March totaled $135.5 million compared to $89.6 million a month earlier.</p>
<p>The country imported 600,000 barrels of oil products in March, most of it gasoline, at a total cost to the nation of $16.5 million.</p>
<p>((-- Juan Guillermo Londono, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
